| `layers.frontend.browser_probe.timeout_seconds` | integer | `10`; absent, `[using default] layers.frontend.browser_probe.timeout_seconds = 10` | a positive integer, at most `threading.TIMEOUT_MAX` seconds | `scripts/preflight.py` through the config loader | Bounds the time preflight waits for the browser registry probe. | installing a browser: `make fe-browsers` | when `frontend_stack` is not `none` |
